{title: Manwa Laage}
{artist: Shreya Ghoshal Arijit Singh Vishal Shekhar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Manwa [C]Lage.. o manwa [C]Lage,        Lage re [Am]sawre
Lage re [F]sawre,        Le tera hua [C]jiya ka,
[Gm]jiya ka, [F]jiya ka ye gaanv [C]re,        Musafir [G]hoon main door ka
diwana [Dm]hoon main dhoop ka,        mujhe na [A#]bhaye..na [Am]bhaye
na [Gm]bhaye chhaaon [C]re..aey,        Manwa [C]Lage.. o manwa [C]Lage
Lage re [Am]sawre,        Lage re [F]sawre
Le tera hua [C]jiya ka,        [Gm]jiya ka, [F]jiya ka ye gaanv [C]re
[C]Aisi waisi boli tere nainon ne boli,        [Am]jane kyun mai doli aisa lage teri ho li
[F]main..tu me [G]raa,        [C]Hmm tune baat kholi kache dhago me piroli
[Am]baaton ki rangoli se na khelu aise holi,        [F]main..na..te [G]raa
[A#]Oo..kisi ka toh [F]hoga hi tu,        [Dm]kyun na tujhe [G]main hi jeetu
[Dm]khule kha [G]bon mey jee [Am]te hain,        jee [Gm]te hain baaw [C]re..aey..
Mann ke [C]dhaage, o mann ke dhaage,        Dhaage pe [Am]saanwre
Dhaage pe [F]saanwre,        Hai likha mene [C]tera hi, [Gm]tera hi,
[F]tera hi to naam [C]re,        [C]Aise dore dale kala jadu naina kale
[Am]Tere mai hawale hua sine se laga le,        [F]Aa.. main [G]tera
[A#]Dono dheeme [F]dheeme jalein,        [Dm]Aaja dono [G]aise milein
[Dm]Zameen pe [G]Lage, na [Am]tere,        na [Gm]mere paanv [C]re
Manwa [C]Lage.. o manwa [C]Lage,        Lage re [Am]sawre
Lage re [F]sawre,        Le tera hua [C]jiya ka,
[Gm]jiya ka, [F]jiya ka ye gaanv [C]re
